  :adr/investigation-findings
  {:repo-inventory
   "kotoba-lang org repos with .kotoba files: kotoba (67), kotoba-lang (5),
    compiler (7), kototama (6), kotoba-v2025 (31, .kotoba-only),
    wasm-webcomponent (4, hosts compiled WASM, doesn't compile .kotoba
